# 20:39. This is the 2026-08-29 defect exactly: a top-five member unshippable because nobody typed a line.
weakdraw_flat_s2026.pt               # LEDGER75 0.8807, epoch 9, 909 rows - the alpha=0.0 control of the
# sample-spread pair. Its job as a control is priced in the ledger against weakdraw_frx; it ships here on
# its own number.
resnet50d_short_s2026.pt             # LEDGER75 0.8663, epoch 6 - the n=1 resnet50d family. Below the
# solo band and kept anyway, because D146 section 3 restored the two-variable D35 gate and a member off
