# nobody chose, and `MemberPackage.spanning` refuses an identifier two roots both hold — so
# `mount_check` failed outright with all six named, which is how this was found rather than by reading.
# They were put here on the premise that shelf 1 is a 10 GB re-push nobody does per member. That premise
# stopped holding at 23:26Z on 2026-09-10, when shelf 1 WAS re-pushed in full for the two fold-0
# teachers; the live `kneemri-members` now carries all six (verified by `kaggle datasets files`), so
# shelf 1 is where they are and this file may not name them. The rule to take forward: check
# `comp/members.roster` for the name BEFORE adding a line here — the shelf split is about what has not
# been pushed yet, never about what is convenient to mount.

                            # against its solo, and expect the divergence to be where its value is if
                            # it has any. Ledger 2026-09-10.
