                            # FIRST. Trained with the 7,369 four-way-extractor-discordant cells masked
                            # (13.94% of cells), evaluated against v2 — which is why it read as a kill:
                            # the ruler scored the missing BIAS as missing supervision. On the 469
                            # blind-adjudicated holdout cells it is the best member on disk on BOTH
                            # columns, accuracy 0.832 and AUC-vs-verdict 0.6982 (M363, 2026-09-11), and
                            # the AUC column is the cut-free one, so the lead is not under-calling.
                            # Rostered to make it SHIPPABLE — its ledger row still says killed and that
                            # row is not yet retracted. Read it as a diversity seat against v2-aligned
                            # members, which is exactly what it is: it never saw the cells they overfit.
                            # No foreign corpus is fitted; the discordance selector is four extractors
                            # reading OUR reports. Ledger 2026-09-11.
v2_corrected_s2026.pt       # The 2,315-cell corrected-table arm the v2 ruler put in band 3. Gold cells
